---
source: tests/sync/write_lib.rs
expression: apply(&switch)
---
## Switch

```
branches:
  - feature_x (or) cargo_features=["feature-x"]
  - feature_y (xor) cargo_features=["feature-y"]
  - lib (or)
```

## Output

### feature_x.rs

```rust
// feature-x
```

### feature_y.rs

```rust
// feature-y
```

### lib.rs

```rust
// always included

#[cfg(all(feature = "feature-x", not(feature = "feature-y")))]
#[path = "feature_x.rs"]
mod feature_x;

#[cfg(feature = "feature-y")]
#[path = "feature_y.rs"]
mod feature_y;
```
